@startuml
title Balance, Expense Posting, and Payment Settlement (proposed)
left to right direction
rectangle "Approved expense" as Expense
rectangle "Payer credit\n+amount paid" as Credit
rectangle "Participant share debits\n− allocated shares" as Debits
rectangle "Authoritative ledger\n(group + currency scoped)" as Ledger
rectangle "Rebuildable balance projection" as Balance
rectangle "Payment request" as Request
rectangle "Transactional due check\n(idempotent + concurrency safe)" as Check
rectangle "Payment + offsetting ledger\neffect committed atomically" as Payment
rectangle "Updated amount due" as Due
Expense --> Credit
Expense --> Debits
Credit --> Ledger
Debits --> Ledger
Ledger --> Balance
Request --> Check
Balance --> Check : current due re-read in transaction
Check --> Payment : amount <= due
Payment --> Ledger
Balance --> Due
Payment --> Due
note bottom
Payer may be a participant; their share offsets payer credit.
Pending/rejected expense has no ledger posting. Excess payment is rejected.
No cross-currency arithmetic without approved conversion.
end note
@enduml
